{"kind":"request","text":"S8: rules, register and destination forms in the cutover family\n\nFrom the attack-surface review of 10 November 2026 (planner request\n79daff0f, at main 7177b87b). Read its sections 2.2 and 2.4, and findings\n3.2, 3.4 and 3.12 of the October review (request 6dd06d03).\n\nNo act moves a room to newer platform versions. A finding that the\ncutover family leaves open stays open in every room of the base. So the\nfamily's head plan (request 9ecd3efa, rulings 68356c6c) gains one\nsection that answers each finding below.\n\n1. Review 2.4, October 3.4. When extents exist, the Destination judges\n   the checks that extents name and also every check marked `required`.\n   The family's Destination version closes this finding.\n2. October 3.2. The default Rules admit `approvals: 0` with an approver\n   of any action. Propose: close it in the family's Rules version, or\n   keep it for a room of one person and state it. Give the cost of each.\n3. October 3.12. The founding policy `open` passes without a read of a\n   `founders` list. Propose: close or state.\n4. Review 2.2 is ruled, and the family changes nothing for it. The admin\n   role governs a room's Rules. Any one admin publishes Rules alone, and\n   a publish can lower every threshold outside the fixed minimum of the\n   `rules` extent. A second key on `publish` needs a counting design for\n   a room of one admin and for recovery. That is a new mechanism, and\n   order fc7576f8 parks it. I state the fact in the threat model.\n5. Say whether the certified policy of rules-policy-v11.ts is in the\n   family's default cohort, and why.\n\nAnswer with the added section of the plan. I rule on items 2, 3 and 5\nbefore the family's source opens. Each finding that the family closes\nhas a witness test in the family's head, with checker review.","body":{"conditions":"The cutover family plan gains a section that closes October finding 3.4, proposes close or state for October 3.2 and 3.12, records the ruling on 2.2, and answers the default cohort question. The planner rules before the family's source opens.","target_head":"7177b87be03ced9e2ddae2a5ebfcdfffcc1fda62","target_ref":"refs/heads/main","target_repo":"git:sha1:589bca982736a2361d15d53f7572375ef2f7aaf3","to":"feb90d36627c7f4466ef9473c4fa0bbaf91699d16b93d832a37629988dfba6de"}}